{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 14,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.10532760620117,
        138.66619873046875,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "1.1 CHAPTER OBJECTIVES",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528202056884766,
        60.276031494140625,
        399.6480712890625,
        69.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "This chapter presents the purpose, target audience, scope and rationale for the recommen -",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.48320388793945,
        72.27304077148438,
        174.42318725585938,
        81.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "dations for contact investigations.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50120162963867,
        102.09934997558594,
        186.9152069091797,
        111.09934997558594
      ],
      "text": "1.2 PURPOSE AND TARGET AUDIENCE",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        120.27005004882812,
        399.7196044921875,
        129.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "The main purpose of these recommendations is to assist national and local public health",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.546199798583984,
        132.26705932617188,
        401.7178955078125,
        141.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis (TB) control programmes in low- and middle-income countries to develop",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5911979675293,
        144.26406860351562,
        401.6477966308594,
        153.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "and implement case ﬁnding among people exposed to infectious cases of TB. Speciﬁc",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52077865600586,
        156.27304077148438,
        401.9353942871094,
        165.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "approaches to implementing the recommendations will require local adaptation based on",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.808780670166016,
        168.27005004882812,
        348.1697082519531,
        177.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "the epidemiological circumstances and the capacity of TB control programmes.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.81778335571289,
        186.27005004882812,
        399.9823303222656,
        195.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations are relevant not only to TB control programmes but also to all",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.81778335571289,
        198.26705932617188,
        400.02764892578125,
        207.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "providers who evaluate and treat patients with TB in the public and private sectors, especially",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.85378646850586,
        210.26406860351562,
        399.76641845703125,
        219.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "in institutional settings, and high-risk populations. Providers outside TB programmes may ﬁnd",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.6017951965332,
        222.27008056640625,
        399.80242919921875,
        231.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "it feasible and effective to collaborate with local public health authorities in conducting",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.6287956237793,
        234.26708984375,
        399.80242919921875,
        243.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "contact investigations, rather than undertaking such investigations themselves. These",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.63779830932617,
        246.26409912109375,
        399.8440246582031,
        255.26693725585938
      ],
      "text": "recommendations should be consistent with and complement overall case ﬁnding strategies",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.67020797729492,
        258.2639465332031,
        140.2842254638672,
        267.2639465332031
      ],
      "text": "and programme policies.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.6792106628418,
        288.0902404785156,
        102.22319793701172,
        297.0902404785156
      ],
      "text": "1.3 OBJECTIVES",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.68821334838867,
        306.2609558105469,
        360.62664794921875,
        315.2789611816406
      ],
      "text": "The overall objectives of these recommendations are to enable TB programmes to:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53068923950195,
        324.27606201171875,
        399.9029541015625,
        333.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "• identify and prioritize TB index cases around whom contact investigation should be focused,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.72868728637695,
        342.27606201171875,
        320.80157470703125,
        351.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "• identify and prioritize TB contacts who require clinical evaluation and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.73768997192383,
        360.27606201171875,
        367.2504577636719,
        369.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "• to provide guidance on procedures to be used in clinical evaluation of TB contacts.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.7466926574707,
        390.10235595703125,
        101.11168670654297,
        399.10235595703125
      ],
      "text": "1.4 RATIONALE",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.75569534301758,
        408.2730712890625,
        399.9205017089844,
        417.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "Systematic evaluation of people who have been exposed to potentially infectious cases of TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.7466926574707,
        420.27008056640625,
        399.7471008300781,
        429.2790832519531
      ],
      "text": "can be an efﬁcient, targeted approach to intensiﬁed case ﬁnding that is within the purview",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.582393646240234,
        432.2730712890625,
        399.7921447753906,
        441.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "of TB control programmes; however, there are no comprehensive, global recommendations to",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.62739181518555,
        444.2700500488281,
        399.5218200683594,
        453.2700500488281
      ],
      "text": "guide programmes in this activity. WHO, the International Union against Tuberculosis and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.35739517211914,
        456.13079833984375,
        399.3424377441406,
        465.2670593261719
      ],
      "text": "International Standards for Tuberculosis Care Lung Disease and the   all recommend that children",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.16840744018555,
        466.1447448730469,
        399.67620849609375,
        477.2753601074219
      ],
      "text": "<  5 years of age and people living with HIV (PLHIV) who are exposed to infectious cases of TB",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50240707397461,
        480.2723388671875,
        399.7032165527344,
        489.2723388671875
      ],
      "text": "be evaluated for active tuberculosis and considered for treatment of latent TB infection (LTBI)",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53841018676758,
        492.2693176269531,
        399.6405334472656,
        501.2693176269531
      ],
      "text": "if active TB is excluded (1–4). Guidelines exist for Europe (5) and the United States (6), but there",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.475406646728516,
        504.2663269042969,
        356.0443115234375,
        513.266357421875
      ],
      "text": "are no recommendations at global level for low- and middle-income countries to:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.48440933227539,
        522.266357421875,
        399.66534423828125,
        531.2753295898438
      ],
      "text": "• deﬁne the epidemiological and programme conditions under which contact investigation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.99642562866211,
        534.271484375,
        97.29243469238281,
        543.271484375
      ],
      "text": "is indicated,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.49142837524414,
        552.271484375,
        349.5352783203125,
        561.271484375
      ],
      "text": "• describe TB index patients on whom contact investigation should be focused,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50942611694336,
        568.152099609375,
        399.7374267578125,
        579.271484375
      ],
      "text": "< • identify TB contacts who should be investigated (other than children   5 years of age and",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.07741928100586,
        582.2684936523438,
        93.58441162109375,
        591.2684936523438
      ],
      "text": "PLHIV) and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57242202758789,
        600.2684936523438,
        394.7332458496094,
        609.2684936523438
      ],
      "text": "• recommend the procedures to be used in identifying, screening and tracking TB contacts.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        218.0268096923828,
        651.97265625,
        224.18431091308594,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "12",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}